  "notes": "Children start grade 1 at age 7. The new curriculum groups grades 1–6 (elementary), 7–8 (intermediate), 9–10 (secondary) and 11–12 (senior secondary, natural or social science streams). UIS's mapping still calls grades 7–8 part of an 8-year primary. The Grade 10 national exam has been discontinued; the Grade 12 exam (ESSLCE) remains."
